I requested a solution to find common elements in two data frames where
there is a common attribute in each.

several options will all do the trick

new.frame <- merge(large.frame, small.frame, by="zone", all.y=T)

new.frame <- large.frame[is.element(small.frame$zone, large.frame$zone),
]

new.frame <- large.frame[match(small.frame$zone,large.frame$zone),]

