> I am wondering what is wrong with handling Hessian matrix.

It is not a matrix, but a 1x2x2 array.  You wanted

                hess1 <- function(th0, th1)
                {
                        dxx <- 12 * (th0 - 1)^2
                        dxy <- 0.5
                        dyy <- 12 * (th1 - 3)^2 
                        matrix(c(dxx, dxy, dxy, dyy), 2, 2)
                }

[formula1(2,2) would have shown you that this was wrong.]

Also, the attribute is supposed to be "gradient" not "grad", which is the
cause of the warning you are getting.

