From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Fri Jul 28 13:07:10 2000
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian Ripley)
Date: Fri, 28 Jul 2000 14:07:10 +0100
Subject: Re: [S] import.data without generating factors
